Market abuse (FIN-MKT-03)

Issuer: Tatra Wealth, o. c. p., a. s. · IČO 36 012 445 · Hodžovo námestie 3, 811 06 Bratislava

Inside information must not be used for a personal trade or a client trade. The Market Abuse Regulation (EU) 596/2014 applies directly in Slovakia and Národná banka Slovenska supervises compliance.
Watch and restricted lists are checked before research is published and before any proprietary order is sent.
Staff personal account dealing needs pre-clearance, and a position is held for the minimum period set in the dealing rules.
A gift or hospitality from an issuer above the firm limit needs compliance pre-clearance and goes into the register.
A suspicious order or transaction is reported to the surveillance desk the same day, which files a suspicious transaction and order report to the regulator.
Insider lists for every project are maintained with the exact time each person received the information.

